3. The learned counsel for the petitioners would submit that the first respondent has no jurisdiction to invoke Section 129 of BNSS as the act of the petitioners do not fall under any of the clauses under Section 129 to empower the first respondent to issue show cause notice under Section 129 of BNSS;
